      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From Bitwarden, Vaultwarden, UwULock, KeePass, KeePassXC, 1Password, Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Apple Passwords, Proton Pass or LastPass. The file is only read here on this device, and you see first what will come in."
