          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With PEAP and TTLS the server is checked. UwULock can only do that through a domain in the CA certificate field (such as radius.example.org) and the system's certificates. Enter the domain or set up the network in the Wi-Fi settings."
